    "detailed_description": "<strong>Fearsome Challengers take to the skies in action-packed battles for glory!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995940/extras/64322559c5268ec6466441a6d5a22fe3.avif?t=1716316781\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Fighting</h2><br>Maneuver through airborne arenas, using your weapons and abilities to defeat opponents, or to knock them out of the sky.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995940/extras/f86e7fee0abffce0a4189fd6d8f649cb.avif?t=1716316781\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Challenger</h2><br>Pick from a variety of brawlers, mages, and hybrid fighters, each with unique weapons and abilities, and a distinct playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995940/extras/977eed367dec54258d04098f8df1fbc6.avif?t=1716316781\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Variety of Game Modes</h2><br>Battle for aerial dominance alone, or alongside a friend. Become the last Challenger standing in death-match, or work to capture your opponents' flag in CTF.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995940/extras/8e399885fafdd2dfac8cd64e3f3de994.avif?t=1716316781\" width=600 height=200 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Fearsome Challengers take to the skies in action-packed battles for glory!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995940/extras/64322559c5268ec6466441a6d5a22fe3.avif?t=1716316781\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Fighting</h2><br>Maneuver through airborne arenas, using your weapons and abilities to defeat opponents, or to knock them out of the sky.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995940/extras/f86e7fee0abffce0a4189fd6d8f649cb.avif?t=1716316781\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Challenger</h2><br>Pick from a variety of brawlers, mages, and hybrid fighters, each with unique weapons and abilities, and a distinct playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995940/extras/977eed367dec54258d04098f8df1fbc6.avif?t=1716316781\" width=600 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Variety of Game Modes</h2><br>Battle for aerial dominance alone, or alongside a friend. Become the last Challenger standing in death-match, or work to capture your opponents' flag in CTF.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995940/extras/8e399885fafdd2dfac8cd64e3f3de994.avif?t=1716316781\" width=600 height=200 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Fight for victory across airborne stages in Cloud Crashers, an arena platformer fighting game in the skies. Choose from a diverse roster of characters with unique weapons and abilities, and brawl it out against other Challengers in intense PvP action!",
